      "id": "note_free_limit",
      "text": "SIGNAL harness. Cabin loom: ECU to bulkhead A/B at the passenger firewall. Engine loom: mating plugs, then one trunk around the motor. Rear (fuel level, rear ABS) bypasses the bulkhead. Power: ST185-Power.harness.",
